abstract: >-
  FairRound runs fair, hourly uniform-price rounds for listings on Arbitrum One,
  with holder-controlled treasuries and elected project leads. From 31 October 2026
  it is used as a public field experiment on how individual users and automated
  wallets behave, and which design defences hold against automation.
  Code, tests and documentation were prepared with assistance from Claude
  (Anthropic), an AI model; the author designed the system and the experiment
  and takes responsibility for the work.
